# Task 143-007 Execution Plan — Relations Hibrit (Backfill + Write-time)

## Overview
Add `insertRelation()` and `getRelations()` public methods to MemoryStore, implement auto-extract
of ADR references (`\bADR-\d{3}\b`) during `insert()`, create a backfill script, add
`deckent memory relations review` CLI command, and wire sprint-finalizer triple-link.

## Steps

### 1. memory-types.ts — Export Relation type (already exists as RelationType + EntryRelation)
- Already has `RelationType` and `EntryRelation` — no changes needed for types
- Add `Relation` interface as alias/helper for backfill script output

### 2. memory-store.ts — Public insertRelation() + getRelations() + auto-extract ADR refs
- Add `insertRelation(fromId, toId, relType)` public method
- Add `getRelations(entryId)` that returns both from and to relations
- Modify `insert()` to auto-extract ADR references from content via regex `\bADR-\d{3}\b`
  and auto-insert `references` relations
- Add static `extractAdrReferences(content)` utility method

### 3. scripts/backfill-relations.mjs — Scan existing entries, generate preview
- Open memory.db, scan all entries for ADR references
- Generate `.brain/exports/relations-backfill-preview.md` with findings
- Execute inserts into relations table

### 4. src/cli/commands/memory.ts — `deckent memory relations review`
- Add `relations review` subcommand
- Show pending relations from preview, allow y/n per relation

### 5. src/orchestra/sprint-finalizer.ts — Triple-link hook
- After sprint finalize, insert 3 relations:
  sprint-log → memory (depends_on), memory → retro (depends_on)

### 6. Tests — 20+ tests across memory-store, finalizer, CLI

## Files Modified
- src/core/memory-types.ts (minor — add Relation convenience type)
- src/core/memory-store.ts (insertRelation, getRelations, auto-extract ADR)
- scripts/backfill-relations.mjs (new)
- src/cli/commands/memory.ts (relations review command)
- src/orchestra/sprint-finalizer.ts (triple-link)
- tests/core/memory-store.test.ts (relation tests)
- tests/orchestra/sprint-finalizer.test.ts (triple-link tests)
